# LINE Flex UX

Keep the Cloudnex palette and bubble anatomy in `src/line/templates/shared.ts`.

NAV HOME / service action lists keep the committed `createTapRow` box (teal, 12px radius, icon in the label string). The only UI-feedback delta vs that commit is type `md` without bold — not `lg`+bold, and not a new icon-column layout. Do not switch those rows back to `type: 'button'` (LINE chrome). Footers stay `createMessageActionButton`. Product pickers use the same box at `sm` on `tealTint`.
